Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal
Description: Keep awake, focus timer and honest work log
 Kaeru is a lightweight desktop utility that prevents unwanted automatic
 system sleep (via the xdg-desktop-portal Inhibit interface with a logind
 fallback), optionally keeps the display awake, runs focus intervals
 (countdown or Pomodoro) and records an honest, suspend-aware work log
 with projects and CSV export.
 .
 It is local-first: no accounts, no cloud, no telemetry, no synthesized
 input activity. It never modifies global power-management settings.
 .
 The frog icon set is Kaeru's official visual identity.